      "-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">gives the data about the </p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\" margin-top:0px; ma"
      "rgin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">number of points pass"
      "ed (as discrete sys)</p></body></html>"
      Position		      [-587, 284, -401, 310]
      InternalMargins	      [0, 0, 0, 0]
      HorizontalAlignment     "left"
      VerticalAlignment	      "top"
      Interpreter	      "rich"
      ZOrder		      -1
    }
  }
}
